203 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 180 0 R
/T (Protecting the City and Taxpayers from Risk As part of this reset, we must also address the legal and financial risk to the city. When policies are unclear, internal controls are weak, or staffing structures do not align with operational needs, the city can be exposed to unnecessary liability and avoidable costs. Addressing these vulnerabilities proactively is essential to protecting taxpayers and ensuring long term stability. This review includes a careful evaluation of organizational structure and staffing. In some cases, improving efficiency and reducing risk may require restructuring or eliminating positions that are redundant, misaligned, or no longer necessary. These decisions are being made based on efficiency, accountability, and compliance with the law.)
/E (Protecting the City and Taxpayers from Risk As part of this reset, we must also address the legal and financial risk to the city. When policies are unclear, internal controls are weak, or staffing structures do not align with operational needs, the city can be exposed to unnecessary liability and avoidable costs. Addressing these vulnerabilities proactively is essential to protecting taxpayers and ensuring long term stability. This review includes a careful evaluation of organizational structure and staffing. In some cases, improving efficiency and reducing risk may require restructuring or eliminating positions that are redundant, misaligned, or no longer necessary. These decisions are being made based on efficiency, accountability, and compliance with the law.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
